# The root .gitignore has `**/[Pp]ackages/*` (the NuGet package-restore rule from
# the Visual Studio template). It also matches the npm workspaces below, which is
# why packages/domain and packages/contracts were never committed. Re-include them;
# the node_modules/ and dist/ rules above still apply inside them.
!packages/*

